ORIGIN
------

The schematic, PCB layout, and the symbols and footprints in lib/ are
original work. The footprints follow the manufacturers' published drawings
(Littelfuse 59170, Lian Xin BS-CR2032-8, Good Display GDC04212) and the
MSP430FR413x pinout follows TI datasheet SLAS865; they contain no
third-party design files.
